[wait time=3000]
[endballoon name=mymelo]
[waitaction name=mymelo script=kubikashige]

; マイメロ照れる
[startanime name=mymelo time=2000 script=munehari script_args={["kiri2",3]}]
[balloon name=mymelo time=3000 type=1]
Melody has become/n
a wonderful room manager#e1#
[wait time=3000]
[endballoon name=mymelo]
[waitaction name=mymelo script=ketsui2]

; マイメロ照れる
[startanime name=mymelo time=2000 script=kubikashige script_args={[3,"smile2"]}]
[balloon name=mymelo time=3000 type=1]
...but, if Melody needs help again,/n
please come help Melody again,/n
#playername#h1#
[wait time=3000]
[endballoon name=mymelo]
[waitaction name=mymelo script=ketsui2]

